{"b":"Ps","c":145,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"I will extol thee, my God, O king; and I will bless thy name for ever and ever.","x":[["Ps.47.6",13,"r"],["Ps.47.8",13,"r"],["Ps.45.6",11,"r"],["Ps.30.12",8,"r"],["Ps.34.1",7,"w"],["Matt.25.34",6,"r"],["Ps.30.1",5,"w"],["Ps.44.4",5,"r"],["Isa.33.22",5,"r"],["Ps.48.2",5,"r"]]},{"n":2,"t":"Every day will I bless thee; and I will praise thy name for ever and ever.","x":[["Rev.7.15",5,"r"],["Ps.71.6",4,"w"],["Ps.119.164",3,"w"],["Ps.72.15",3,"r"]]},{"n":3,"t":"Great is the LORD, and greatly to be praised; and his greatness is unsearchable.","it":[[6,8],[64,66]],"x":[["Ps.147.5",20,"r"],["Rom.11.33",18,"w"],["Job.5.9",16,"w"],["Isa.40.28",15,"r"],["Job.9.10",11,"r"],["Ps.139.6",10,"r"],["Ps.48.1",10,"e"],["Ps.96.4",7,"e"],["Job.26.14",6,"r"],["Rev.15.3",6,"r"]]},{"n":4,"t":"One generation shall praise thy works to another, and shall declare thy mighty acts.","x":[["Ps.78.3",10,"r"],["Ps.78.7",10,"w"],["Ps.71.18",10,"w"],["Deut.6.7",8,"r"],["Isa.38.19",8,"w"],["Ps.44.1",6,"r"],["Ps.44.2",6,"r"],["Exod.12.26",5,"r"],["Exod.12.27",5,"r"],["Josh.4.21",5,"r"]]},{"n":5,"t":"I will speak of the glorious honour of thy majesty, and of thy wondrous works.","x":[["Isa.12.4",8,"r"],["Ps.119.27",6,"w"],["Ps.104.1",3,"w"],["Ps.104.2",3,"r"],["Dan.4.37",3,"w"],["Ps.105.2",3,"w"],["Ps.71.24",3,"r"],["Dan.4.1",3,"r"],["Dan.4.3",3,"r"],["Ps.72.18",3,"w"]]},{"n":6,"t":"And men shall speak of the might of thy terrible acts: and I will declare thy greatness.","it":[[4,7]],"x":[["Hab.2.14",7,"r"],["Dan.3.28",7,"r"],["Dan.3.29",7,"r"],["Ps.107.31",7,"r"],["Ps.107.32",7,"r"],["Ps.22.27",5,"r"],["Ps.126.2",5,"r"],["Ps.126.3",5,"r"],["Ps.22.31",5,"w"],["Ps.113.3",5,"r"]]},{"n":7,"t":"They shall abundantly utter the memory of thy great goodness, and shall sing of thy righteousness.","x":[["Isa.63.7",10,"w"],["Ps.51.14",6,"w"],["Ps.71.19",5,"w"],["Ps.36.10",5,"w"],["Rev.19.1",5,"r"],["Rev.19.3",5,"r"],["Ps.72.1",5,"w"],["Ps.72.3",5,"w"],["Rev.15.3",4,"w"],["Rev.15.4",4,"r"]]},{"n":8,"t":"The LORD is gracious, and full of compassion; slow to anger, and of great mercy.","it":[[9,11]],"x":[["Num.14.18",20,"e"],["Ps.103.8",17,"q"],["Ps.86.5",13,"w"],["Ps.100.5",9,"w"],["Ps.116.5",9,"w"],["Ps.86.15",8,"e"],["Mic.7.18",7,"w"],["Mic.7.20",7,"w"],["Rom.5.20",7,"r"],["Rom.5.21",7,"r"]]},{"n":9,"t":"The LORD is good to all: and his tender mercies are over all his works.","it":[[9,11],[48,51]],"x":[["Nah.1.7",14,"r"],["Ps.100.5",11,"r"],["Matt.5.45",8,"r"],["Ps.36.6",4,"r"],["Ps.36.7",4,"r"],["Jonah.4.11",4,"r"],["Ps.104.27",4,"r"],["Acts.17.25",4,"r"],["Acts.14.17",3,"r"],["Ps.65.9",3,"r"]]},{"n":10,"t":"All thy works shall praise thee, O LORD; and thy saints shall bless thee.","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O LORD”."},"x":[["Ps.19.1",10,"r"],["Ps.103.22",8,"w"],["1Pet.2.9",3,"r"],["Ps.30.4",2,"w"],["Ps.104.24",2,"w"],["Heb.13.15",2,"w"],["Ps.32.11",2,"r"],["Ps.98.3",2,"r"],["Ps.98.9",2,"r"],["Isa.44.23",2,"r"]]},{"n":11,"t":"They shall speak of the glory of thy kingdom, and talk of thy power;","x":[["Isa.9.6",4,"r"],["Isa.9.7",4,"w"],["1Chr.29.11",4,"w"],["1Chr.29.12",4,"w"],["Ps.93.1",4,"r"],["Ps.93.2",4,"r"],["Ps.45.6",4,"w"],["Ps.45.7",4,"r"],["Rev.11.15",3,"r"],["Rev.11.17",3,"w"]]},{"n":12,"t":"To make known to the sons of men his mighty acts, and the glorious majesty of his kingdom.","x":[["Ps.105.1",4,"w"],["Rev.12.10",3,"w"],["Ps.105.5",3,"r"],["Matt.28.18",3,"r"],["Ps.98.1",3,"r"],["Rev.19.15",2,"r"],["Rev.19.16",2,"r"],["Dan.4.34",2,"w"],["Dan.4.35",2,"r"],["Ps.106.2",2,"w"]]},{"n":13,"t":"Thy kingdom is an everlasting kingdom, and thy dominion endureth throughout all generations.","it":[[12,14],[56,64]],"x":[["1Tim.1.17",7,"r"],["Dan.7.14",5,"e"],["Ps.10.16",5,"r"],["Isa.9.7",4,"w"],["Rev.11.15",3,"r"],["Dan.2.44",3,"w"],["Dan.7.27",2,"e"],["2Pet.1.11",2,"w"],["1Cor.15.21",1,"r"],["1Cor.15.28",1,"r"]]},{"n":14,"t":"The LORD upholdeth all that fall, and raiseth up all those that be bowed down.","